# Shadcn & UI Styling

## Where code lives

- Primitives: `src/components/ui/` — presentation only, no business logic
- App chrome: `src/components/layout/` — header, layout shells, shared chrome
- Domain UI: `src/features/<domain>/components/`

## Colors — tokens only in components

Use semantic Tailwind classes, never raw hex/oklch in TSX:

- Page canvas: `bg-background`
- Elevated surfaces (cards, header, dialogs, inputs, outline buttons): `bg-card`
- Subtle fills / ghost hover: `bg-muted`, `hover:bg-muted`
- Text: `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `text-primary`, `text-destructive`
- Borders: `border-border`, `border-input`
- Actions: `bg-primary text-primary-foreground`, `bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground`

Edit actual color values only in `src/app/globals.css` (`:root` CSS variables, hex).

## Elevation model

| Surface | Token | Use for |
|---------|-------|---------|
| Page | `bg-background` | Body, main layout areas |
| Raised | `bg-card` | Cards, header, popovers, inputs, outline buttons |
| Subtle | `bg-muted` | Insets, ghost hover, notification btn bg uses `bg-background` on card |

## Components

- Conditional classes: `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- **Button**: prefer existing variants (`default`, `outline`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `destructive`); outline uses `bg-card hover:bg-muted`
- **Input**: `bg-card border-input` — white fields on gray page canvas
- **Icons**: `@hugeicons/react` + `@hugeicons/core-free-icons`; default `strokeWidth={2}`
- **Dialogs/alerts**: use shadcn primitives; surfaces use `bg-popover` / `bg-card`

## CSS / theming notes

- Theme tokens live in `globals.css`; `@theme inline` bridges vars to Tailwind
- Use `color-mix(in srgb, …)` if mixing CSS vars in arbitrary values — not `oklch`
- Dark mode exists in CSS but is disabled via `isDarkModeEnabled` in `theme-config.ts`

